ccent  you know I mean over Kenny Ortega let  him hold on to that one since it fits  his character hairy like a glove or  should we say a hook they dye their hair  The Descendants cast is known for having  very colorful hair especially the  villains but while some of them wear  wigs to achieve their vibrant hair  colors dub Cameron and Sofia Carson wore  wigs that required them to sit for hours  at a time  let the late Cameron boys kick things up  a notch to get ready for his role he  spent six hours in a salon chair dyeing  his hair platinum blonde he totally  rocked this look on and off screen but  by descendant 3 Cameron was ready to put  down the hair dye and bring on the wig  voice training if you want Kenny Ortega  to be impressed by your work ethic you  want to come to the studio prepared so  trading your voice ahead of time is  something the descendants cast  constantly does this way when they're  ready to record their songs their  pitches are perfect and they're hitting  every single note unlike the other  members of the cast booboo Stewart  wasn't exactly known for his singing  abilities so he prepared himself by  taking singing lessons before shooting  the movies but despite being triple  threats themselves even dub Cameron  Sophia Carson and Cameron Boyce made it  a point to sharpen their vocal chords  they study their characters The  Descendants franchise is deeply rooted  in the Disney Princess universe so every  character has a backstory to get into  character the cast studied Disney movies  and drew inspiration from their  on-screen parents when china anne  mcclain found out that she was being  cast as uma daughter of ursula she binge  watched The Little Mermaid 20 times she  did this to study how Ursula moved and  talked so that she could get into  character but she wasn't alone in doing  this nearly everyone in The Descendants  franchise made it a point to study their  characters before filming the movies  they get their feedback before the  Disney Channel green lights a movie they  want to make sure that their script is  perfect but to do that they have to  workshop a couple of different ideas  first their plot lines are constantly  changing and sometimes they like to let  their main actors in on the process dove  Cameron admitted that she was in on the  writing of the plot before descendant  three hit the production stage the main  actors saw the script evolve and even  gave their feedback this gave them  plenty of time to get ready for their  roles dev stated that she's known who  her real father is since the very  beginning they memorized their scripts  this is a given for any actor and it's  one of the most important things an  actor can do to get ready for an  upcoming role once the cast of  descendants gets their script they start  memorizing it and getting into character  every line is accounted for it the MOR  dub knows about the script the more time  she has to develop her character and  this goes for every other cast member -  well it's perfectly normal to forget  your lines now and then no one likes to  work with someone who doesn't come  prepared they try on their costumes if  there's one thing that The Descendants  franchise doesn't skimp out on it's  glamorous outfits they have costume  designer Karis on from Project Runway  working on the cast costumes and  creating the perfect looks takes time to  get ready for their roles The  Descendants cast has to spend time  trying on their new outfit this gives  Kara plenty of time to see what works  and what doesn't and once the main  actors know what their fierce new looks  are all about they can truly start  getting into character that's a wrap on  how the cast of descendants gets ready  for their roles who's your favorite DK  you make sure you get your cut  tell us in the comments for more videos  about your favorite Disney movies and TV  shows subscribe to the things and don't  forget to give us a big thumbs up thanks  for watching we'll catch you 